# Local development.
#
# Both are intentionally unset: the Vite proxy (vite.config.js) forwards
# /api/dev and /i to localhost:4000, which keeps the preview iframe same-origin
# so no CSP negotiation is needed while developing.
#
# To test on a real phone over your LAN, point both at your machine's IP:
#   VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.1.42:4000
#   VITE_PUBLIC_INVITE_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.42:4000
